# Cloudflare Pages + Worker + KV

This app deploys on **Cloudflare Workers** via **OpenNext** (`@opennextjs/cloudflare`), with **Cloudflare KV** (`env.DB`) as the primary database.

## Platform

- Use Wrangler (`wrangler.jsonc`) and OpenNext (`open-next.config.ts`); do not reintroduce Vercel Postgres or Prisma.
- Access bindings with `getCloudflareContext({ async: true })` from `@opennextjs/cloudflare`.
- Avoid Node-only packages (`fs`, TCP DB clients, native addons). Prefer Workers-compatible APIs.

## Data layer

- One denormalized JSON document per group at `group:{groupId}` (see `src/lib/kv/*` and `src/lib/api.ts`).
- Categories live under the `categories` key (seeded).
- Concurrent group writes are **last-write-wins**.
- Do not use KV for large binaries; document/receipt uploads are out of scope until R2 is added.

## Local / deploy

- Local: `npm run dev` (OpenNext dev bindings) or `npm run preview`.
- Deploy: `npm run deploy`.
- Keep README and `.env.example` aligned with Pages/Workers + KV (no Postgres URLs).
